# A loop of mandatory actions that changes a life total each time round is no draw: it goes on until the life runs out
# (CR 104.4b, 704.5a). Bot2 has Rampaging Ferocidon ("Whenever another creature enters, this creature deals 1 damage to that
# creature's controller"). On turn 7 Bot1 animates its Entombed Worldgorger Dragon, and the Dragon loop of the draw
# scenarios begins: the Dragon exiles Animate Dead and Bot1's Swamps, Animate Dead's leaves ability sacrifices it, its
# leaves ability returns them, and Animate Dead, whose only choice of host is the Dragon, returns it - each step forced, at
# every priority nobody able to do anything but pass or tap a Swamp for mana that buys nothing. Each time the Dragon enters,
# the Ferocidon's ability, Bot2's alone (APNAP, CR 101.4), deals 1 damage to Bot1. Every round comes back to the same
# board, but with Bot1 a life lower, so the position never repeats: the twentieth time the Dragon enters Bot1 is at 0 life
# and loses the game (CR 704.5a), and Bot2 wins. Had the life total been left out of what makes a position, the loop would
# have been found a draw at its second round.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Animate Dead
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Worldgorger Dragon
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Rampaging Ferocidon
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Worldgorger Dragon)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Rampaging Ferocidon.Cast
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Entomb; Worldgorger Dragon
? Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Rampaging Ferocidon
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Animate Dead.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Worldgorger Dragon)

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Status = Lost
Bot1.Life = 0
Bot2.Life = 20
Turn = 7
Step = Main1
